/*
  InputCommandTile.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0232 · InputCommandTile (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `InputCommandTile` resolves (table "InputCommandTile") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact key extracted from the web source
  (features/system/components/InputCommandTile.tsx). The second group backs the
  native chrome (the P4 leaf freshness / loading / empty / error copy and the
  VoiceOver wording the web derives from glyphs), so the Swift sources hold no
  English literals. The third group mirrors the command-catalog label/sublabel keys
  the previews reference, with the web fallbacks, so the tile renders before the
  shared catalog is merged.
*/

